    "intro_html":  "Cape Malay curry came out of Cape Town, built by cooks who brought Indonesian and Malay spicing into a South African kitchen. What makes it different from every other curry on this site is the balance: warm spices like cinnamon and garam masala, a tomato base with no coconut milk anywhere, and a spoonful of sugar and lemon at the end that turns the whole thing sweet-savory. Each bowl runs \u003cstrong\u003e{{cal}} calories and {{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e for about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}}\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost).",
